        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(snapshot): store UISnapshot target cache in OSAllocatedUnfairLock",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n`UISnapshot` stored app/window cache fields as `nonisolated(unsafe)` written from actor-isolated methods and read from `nonisolated` computed properties.\n\nThis PR moves the cache into `OSAllocatedUnfairLock`.\n\n## Failure scenario\n\n1. One isolation domain updates `setScreenshot` / `setTargetMetadata`.\n2. Another reads `applicationName` / `windowTitle` concurrently via nonisolated accessors.\n3. Unfixed: data race on the cached properties.\n\n## Real behavior proof\n\nConcurrent lock-backed cache stress matching the PR shape:\n\n```\nLAST_APP=App98\nPROOF_OK\n```\n\nAlso: `swift build --target PeekabooAgentRuntime` → complete.\n\n## Scope\n\n`UISnapshot` target cache only.",
